flowchart TD
  A[Find an incorrect or risky sample] --> B{Does the baseline also fail this kind?}
  B -->|Yes| C[Check baseline limits or label distribution]
  B -->|No| D{Is coverage low or is a key term OOV?}
  C --> D
  D -->|Yes| E[Check normalization, tokenization, and data coverage]
  D -->|No| F{Do similar expressions fail repeatedly?}
  E --> F
  F -->|Yes| G[Consider representation or model limits]
  F -->|No| H[Record a boundary case or label ambiguity]
